flowchart TD
    Patient[Prospective Patient]
    Frontend[React Frontend\nPublic forms + protected workspace]
    Turnstile[Cloudflare Turnstile]

    subgraph Backend["FastAPI Modular Monolith"]
        Access[Access Control]
        Inquiries[Inquiry Module]
        Content[Public Content Module]
        Testimonials[Testimonial Module]
    end

    DB[(Supabase PostgreSQL)]
    Storage[Supabase Storage]
    Email[Resend]
    Admin[Clinic Admin]
    Staff[Front Desk Staff]

    Patient -->|Browse site and open inquiry flow| Frontend
    Frontend -->|Anti-spam challenge| Turnstile
    Turnstile -->|Challenge token| Frontend
    Frontend -->|Minimal inquiry payload + token| Inquiries
    Inquiries -->|Verify token| Turnstile
    Inquiries -->|Store inquiry and status| DB
    Inquiries -->|Notify clinic team| Email

    Admin -->|Sign in and manage content| Frontend
    Staff -->|Sign in and review inquiries| Frontend
    Frontend -->|Protected API calls| Access
    Access -->|Authorize admin/staff scope| Inquiries
    Access -->|Authorize admin workflows| Content
    Access -->|Authorize testimonial approval| Testimonials

    Content -->|Save bilingual content and clinic profile| DB
    Testimonials -->|Save approval state and copy| DB
    Testimonials -->|Store media assets| Storage
    DB -->|Published content and scoped inquiry data| Frontend
